      </div>
      <h3>Reaching out to a peer at a target company</h3>
      <div style="background:rgba(10,16,24,0.7); border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); border-radius:10px; padding:14px; font-size:0.87rem; color:var(--muted); margin-bottom:16px; line-height:1.7;">
